'''MLG''' was a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[MLG Box]]. MLG was retextured and has now been replaced by [[Shiny]].
==Appearance==
Its blade and handle use a rainbow color scheme with MLG memes imprinted all over it, hence the name. The guard is chrome white.

==Trivia==

*This, along with every other item in the [[MLG Box]], was removed from all player's [[Inventory|inventories]].
*MLG stands for Major League Gaming.

